<title>USA: Ingram Micro IPO price range raised.</title>
<headline>Ingram Micro IPO price range raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The estimated price range on Ingram Micro Inc's initial public offering has been raised to $17 to $19 per share from $14 to $16 per share, said lead underwriter Morgan Stanley on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The 20 million share offering is slated to make its market debut later this week.</p>
<p>Ingram Micro, headquartered in Santa Ana, Calif., is the world's largest distributor of microcomputer products, with 1995 sales of $8.6 billion.</p>
<p>---New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
